@Fiore_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5090
@ProductId = replace-with-a-product-id-from-the-catalogue-response

GET {{Fiore_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Fiore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/products?page=1&pageSize=12
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Fiore_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/products/{{ProductId}}
Accept: application/json
